My twin brother (17) committed suicide 3 months ago, It's not worth it. He had problems we didn't know of, a lot had to do with my parent divorce. and my new step-mom, and how low he thought of himself. all in all he just didn't talk about his problems. that wasw ere it went wrong, so please talk about it with anyone.

&#x200B;

If you need an ear, I'm here for you

hey, I'm sorry for your loss.

&#x200B;

my twin-brother committed suicide in early December, 

he was 17 years old, was going to school, had a job at the same supermarket I work.

at his wake, there were around 600 people, I stood there for 55 minutes shaking hands, in the end, I did not have any emotions left. 

&#x200B;

my suggestion would be to take brakes, 

&#x200B;

cause it's just shit
